sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as Frontend
    participant Reader as Read-only child
    participant Engine as Owned Engine relay
    participant Down as Lifecycle owner
    CLI->>Reader: Exact saved selection + lifetime pipe
    Reader->>Engine: Inspect identity and start generation
    Reader->>Engine: GET logs (follow, tail, since)
    loop Bounded output, consumer backpressure
        Engine-->>Reader: Multiplexed log bytes
        Reader-->>CLI: At most 4 KiB per envelope
    end
    Note over Reader,Down: Reader holds no mutation lease
    Down->>Engine: Stop or remove owned container
    Engine-->>Reader: EOF or idle after service stop
    Reader->>Engine: Check exact selected generation
    alt Real EOF and confirmed stopped or absent
        Reader-->>CLI: Exit 0
    else Five idle seconds without EOF after stop
        Reader-->>CLI: native_log_stopped_idle, exit 1
    else Changed identity or unexplained EOF
        Reader-->>CLI: Named refusal
    end
    Note over CLI,Reader: Ctrl-C stops and reaps reader
    Note over CLI,Reader: Frontend death closes lifetime pipe
